# tbl/jp.tbl: the game's text encoding (docs/re/text.md). Code = font cell; 2-byte codes are written
# as lead byte + low byte (0x01-0x0B lead). Control codes verified against the preprocessor 0x08007568 and
# the renderer 0x08007830. Kanji (0x200-0x6FF): only the cells the script uses, read off the font in context.
